      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8405d088",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: bacon_and_cats_meme; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes an image of three cats with a plate of bacon, with text reading 'for no reason' and 'here's an image of bacon and cats'. The intent is purely humorous and absurd, playing on the common association of cats with bacon (as a food they might be tempted by). There is no toxicity, harmful content, or targeting of any protected group. The humor stems from the unexpected and random pairing of the two images, which is a common meme format used for lighthearted, non-malicious comedic effect.",
