      "label": "bacon_and_cats_scene",
      "description": "A scene composed of two distinct visual panels: the top panel shows three cats sitting side-by-side on a ledge, and the bottom panel shows a wooden cutting board with cooked bacon strips. The two panels are juxtaposed vertically, with text overlaying each panel. The cats are positioned centrally in the top panel, while the bacon is arranged in a row on the cutting board in the bottom panel. The scene is structured to create a humorous, absurd juxtaposition between cats and bacon, as indicated by the text.",
